# Phase 6 – Project Testing

## Testing Objective

The objective of testing is to verify that the Client Script and UI Policy work correctly on the Incident form.

## Test Cases

| Test Case | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Open Incident form | Form opens successfully | Pass |
| Select required condition | Field behavior changes | Pass |
| UI Policy condition is true | Configured field action is applied | Pass |
| UI Policy condition is false | Normal field behavior is maintained | Pass |
| Save Incident | Incident is saved successfully | Pass |

## Testing Result

The configured Client Script and UI Policy were tested on the Incident form.

The required field behavior was successfully applied according to the configured conditions.

## Conclusion

The project configuration works as expected and satisfies the defined requirements.
